# Records the live tool-row board (scripts/demo-ui.ts live) — fictional data only.
Output docs/images/flow-live-row.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1050
Set Height 420
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 20
Hide
Type "node --import tsx scripts/demo-ui.ts live"
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /flow parallel/
Show
Sleep 12s
